  "fullContentHtml": "<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<center>\n<!-- Internal_head_07-11-2024 -->\n\n</center>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3a6be1b8 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%;height: 225px\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%;text-align: center;height: 36px;border-style: none\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>Name Of Post :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%;height: 36px;border-style: none\">\n<h1><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>IIM Common Admission Test CAT Admission Apply Online Form 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></h1>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%;text-align: center;height: 35px;border-style: none\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>Post Date / Update :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%;height: 35px;border-style: none\">03 August 2026 | 10:20 AM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 154px\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%;text-align: center;height: 154px;border-style: none\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>Short Information </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%;height: 154px;border-style: none;vertical-align: middle\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">IIM Indian Institute of Management IIM has released Common Admission Test CAT Notification 2026. Those candidates who are interested in this IIM CAT Admission can Apply Online from <strong>03 August 2026 to 15 September 2026.</strong> Read the notification for Admissions eligibility, Course Details information, Document Required, age limit, How to Apply and all other information</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<center>\n<!-- SR26042026_Square -->\n\n</center>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"social-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"social-box telegram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111646.png\">\n        <span>Telegram</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariResult2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box whatsapp\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/733/733585.png\">\n        <span>WhatsApp</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://www.whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va5IElwBlHpVBd6i5a18\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box instagram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111463.png\">\n        <span>Instagram</span>\n    </div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box twitter\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5968/5968958.png\">\n        <span>X</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/srofficial2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Follow</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"v-sarkariresult\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-48617a69 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%;height: 1883px\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 248px\">\n<td style=\"width: 168.95%;height: 248px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Indian Institute of Management (IIM)</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>IIM Common Admission Test CAT 2026 Online Form</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>IIM CAT 2026 Admissions : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 224px\">\n<td style=\"height: 224px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<b> 03/08/2026</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>15/09/2026 upto 05 PM Only.</b></span></li>\n<li>Last Date Pay Exam Fee :<b>15/09/2026</b></li>\n<li>Exam Date :<strong>29/11/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available :<b> 04/11/2026</b></li>\n<li>Result Status :<strong>January 2027</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 224px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS: <b>2700/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : <b>1350/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Fee Mode or Pay Through E Challan.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 210px\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.0787%;height: 210px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>IIM CAT Eligibility 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream with At Least Minimum 50% Marks</li>\n<li>For SC / ST Candidates : 45% Marks</li>\n<li>For More Details Read the Notification</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></h3>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%;height: 210px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Participating IIM’s</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahmedabad, Amritsar, Bangalore, Bodh Gaya, Calcutta, Guwahati, Indore, Jammu, Kashipur, Kozhikode, Lucknow, Mumbai, Nagpur, Raipur, Ranchi, Rohtak, Sambalpur, Shillong, Sirmaur, Tiruchirappalli, Udaipur, Visakhapatnam.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 130px\">\n<td style=\"width: 168.95%;height: 130px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>IIM CAT 2026 Admissions : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">Courses Details</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Post Graduate Programmes in Management (PGP)</li>\n<li>Fellowship Programmes in Management (FPM) / (PHD)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 283px\">\n<td style=\"height: 283px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>How to Fill IIM CAT Admission Online Form 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Indian Institute of Management IIM are Issued Information Brochure and Invited Online Application Form for the IIM CAT Admission 2026 Candidate Can Apply Online from <strong>03 August, 2026 to 15 September 2026.</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Admission Application Form in IIM CAT Admission 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Admission Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"height: 104px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px\">\n<td style=\"width: 168.95%;height: 146px\" colspan=\"10\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.0787%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 168.95%;text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Apply Online</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"IIM CAT 2026 Registration Link\" href=\"https://iimcat.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.0787%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>How To Fill Form (Hindi Video)</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"IIM CAT 2026 Registration Link\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-aO-wAupJ84\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Watch Video</b></a><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.0787%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download Information Brochure</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"IIM CAT 2026 Full Information Brochure PDF\" href=\"https://cdn.digialm.com/per/g06/pub/32842/EForms/image/CAT2026/CAT_2026_Information_Bulletin_26-07-26.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.0787%;height: 104px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008080\"><b>Signature Resizer, PDF Compress, Age Calculator and More Tools</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%;height: 104px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.0787%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.0787%;text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Official Website</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"IIM CAT Admission 2026 Official Website\" href=\"https://iimcat.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>CAT 2026 Official Website</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<div>\n\n<!-- Internal_header_07-11-2024 -->\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q1. When did the IIM CAT Admission 2026 Online Application Process Start?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process started on <strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"743\">03 August 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q2.</strong><strong>What is the Exam Date for IIM CAT Admission 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The Examination will begin on <strong>29 November 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q3. Where can I find the syllabus for the IIM CAT Admission Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q4. How can I download the IIM CAT Admission 2026 Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q5. What is the last date to apply online for IIM CAT Admission Online Form 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>15 September 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q6. What is the last date to IIM CAT Admission pay the application fee?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">15 September 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q7. How can I apply for IIM CAT Admission Online Form 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_27550\" aria-d